   ],
   "jp": "海斗にまでひどいことするなんて！\nもう　ゆるさないんだから！",
   "en": "Being so cruel, even to Kaito!\nI'll never forgive you!"
  },
  {
   "id": "battle_msg_battle_msg_ep00:003E",
   "idx": [
    1
   ],
   "jp": "海斗くんや{h }みんなの{h }きもちを\nばかにするだなんて{h }ゆるせない！",
   "en": "Mocking the feelings of Kaito and\neveryone? That's unforgivable!"
  },
  {
   "id": "battle_msg_battle_msg_ep00:0080",
   "idx": [
    2
   ],
   "jp": "海斗や{h }みんなの{h }きもちを\nあざわらうだなんて{h }ゆるせない！",
   "en": "Sneering at the feelings of Kaito\nand everyone? I won't forgive that!"
  },
